    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. i'm mostly worried about the \"security measures\" part. like, what does that actually mean in practice for someone my size? i don't want anything \"sneaky\" happening with the data or anything like that, ya know? just want to make sure nothing is being mishandled behind the scenes.",
