      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For a small business like yours, \"security measures\" mainly mean using a strong password to protect your shop's login and encrypting payment data so hackers can't read it. You should also avoid storing unnecessary personal details and ensuring your website uses a secure connection (SSL) to hide data from prying eyes. Simpler steps like training your staff to not share passwords or using a reputable, secure payment processor are often enough to keep your operations safe.",
