    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok that makes sense. i think i'll stick to a reputable payment processor then. one more thing though—what about if an actual breach happens? like if someone secretly gets into my database and starts messing with the info or taking it without me knowing? how should i handle that legally?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
